{
  "allowed_use": "Discrete launch facts only: which mcBLAS compiled program, launch grid, block size, CTA count, split-K factor and split-K reduction epilogue the vendor selector picks for each deployed dense decode projection shape at each swept M. It is an identity map; it carries no timing and no service coefficient, and it selects nothing in Forward on its own. Its purpose is to bound the islands inside which a per-program operand-pipeline coefficient may legally be extracted.",
